--- !u!114 &814400371
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 814400369}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8315fe85224e0bd48b5a33133c740d5d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - name: Nicolaus Copernicus
    npcImage: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Something is wrong... That shouting \u2014 it\u2019s coming from the village
      gates"
    - I was warned they might come. Men sent to silence my voice before my ideas
      take root.
    - They may not wear the robes of priests, but they serve the same fear. Fear
      of change.
    - I cannot fight. My hands were made for quills, not blades.
    - "But you\u2026 You seem capable. Help me hold them off. Protect my notes, my
      instruments \u2014 and my life, if it comes to that.\u201D"
  - name: Nicolaus Copernicus
    npcImage: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Word has reached me \u2014 agents of the Inquisition are on their way. I\u2019ve
      been named a heretic for what I\u2019ve written\u2026 for daring to say the
      Earth moves"
    - I must leave this place at once and reach the monastery deep in the forest.
      There, I may find shelter and continue my work in secret
    - "But the path is not safe. I\u2019ve seen strangers near the woods. Armed men.
      Wolves.\u201D\n\u201CI need someone I can trust \u2014 someone like you"
    - "Escort me to the monastery. Keep me alive. If we fall, so does everything
      I\u2019ve discovered."
    - Follow the torches, they lead the way to the monastery.
  sceneName: 
  isSpecialAction: 0
  detectionRadius: 5
  eagleAchievedTrigger: 0
  powerBookTrigger: 0
  quests:
  - questName: Escape of Copernicus
    questDescription: Escort Copernicus
    isCompleted: 0
