--- !u!114 &2053762292
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2053762290}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8315fe85224e0bd48b5a33133c740d5d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - name: Nicolaus Copernicus - stealing
    npcImage: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - We made it. I owe you more than I can say
    - "This place\u2026 it may not look like much, but within these walls, I can
      think freely again \u2014 at least for a time"
    - But there is more to be done
    - Bishop Giese, my friend and protector, wishes to help me continue my work in
      Olsztyn, where I will have access to better instruments and clearer skies
    - Yet not all in the Church agree. Some still fear what I might find written
      in the stars
    - "The Bishop has asked for your help. He needs someone persuasive \u2014 someone
      unbound by robes or rank \u2014 to sway the clergy to support our efforts"
    - "Bishop Giese believes a certain document \u2014 a sealed letter kept by Canon
      Dobrowolski \u2014 contains support for our cause from higher authorities in
      Krak\xF3w"
    - "If you could obtain it quietly\u2026 without alerting the wrong eyes\u2026
      it may change everything"
    - "I won\u2019t ask you to steal. But if you do\u2026 make sure no one sees you"
  - name: Nicolaus Copernicus - bandits
    npcImage: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "The shadows lengthen. The Inquisition grows desperate. They know what is at
      stake \u2014 and they will stop at nothing to silence us"
    - This letter we carry is more than parchment and ink. It is a beacon of hope,
      a key to unlock the future of knowledge
    - We must be swift, yet cautious. Your skill and resolve are the only shields
      between truth and oblivion
    - "Should they fall upon us, do not falter. Protect me as I protect this fragile
      flame of discovery \u2014 for the stars wait for no one."
  - name: Nicolaus Copernicus - Finaly safe
    npcImage: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Thanks to you, I stand safe once more \u2014 free to pursue the heavens without
      fear"
    - Your courage has saved not just me, but the future of knowledge itself.
    - I am deeply grateful. Together, we will unveil the secrets written in the stars
  sceneName: 
  isSpecialAction: 0
  detectionRadius: 5
  eagleAchievedTrigger: 0
  powerBookTrigger: 0
  quests:
  - questName: Steal sealed letter from Dobrowolski
    questDescription: stealing letter
    isCompleted: 0
